  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Origanum dictamnus",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Origanum_dictamnus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1354661277,
      "text": "Origanum dictamnus, the dittany of Crete, Cretan dittany or hop marjoram, is a tender perennial plant that grows 20–30 cm high. It is known in Greek as δίκταμο or in the Cretan dialect as έρωντας. It is a therapeutic and aromatic plant that grows wild only on the mountainsides and gorges of the Greek island of Crete. It is widely used for food flavouring and medicinal purposes, in addition to featuring as an ornamental plant in gardens. This small, lanate shrub is easily recognised by the distinctive soft, woolly covering of white-grey hair on its stems and round green leaves, giving it a velvety texture. Its tiny rose-pink flowers are surrounded by brighter purple-pink bracts in summer and autumn. The dittany is classified as vulnerable on the IUCN Red List of Threatened Plant Species 1997."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Origanum dictamnus",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Origanum_dictamnus",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171581475,
      "text": "El orégano de Creta es una hierba perenne de la familia lamiaceae."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Dictame de Crète",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dictame_de_Cr%C3%A8te",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 238662343,
      "text": "Le Dictame de Crète est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Lamiacées. C'est une plante herbacée vivace originaire de Crète, une île grecque de la mer Égée. En Grec, elle est appelée Δίκταμο (díktamo) et en dialecte crétois Έρωντας, Στοματόχορτο \"herbe pour l'estomac\" ou μαλλιαρό χόρτο \"herbe laineuse\", Σταματόχορτο \"herbe coagulante\"."
    }
